#34306
The Central Staff Commons~
A broad circular commons forms the social and operational center of the
immortal complex. Comfortable seating surrounds a low conversation
hearth beneath restrained banners and service emblems. The four main
foyers open north, east, south, and west, while the route down returns
toward Midgaard. Staff are welcome to rest here, but the room remains a
workplace built around service rather than status.
